WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.835
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:04.203
We hope you're all doing well.

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:06.372
And now if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.372 --> 00:00:09.542
President Biden spoke to
Britain's King Charles yesterday

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:12.378
for the first time since
Queen Elizabeth's passing.

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:16.048
"I can't believe you waited your
entire life for this lousy job,"

00:00:16.048 --> 00:00:18.051
said both of them
at the same time.

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:20.553
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:23.756
A possible national railroad
strike was averted today

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:26.726
after 20 hours of talks between
the union's leadership

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:28.728
and labor negotiators
from the railroads.

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:31.731
20 hours of talks
that were very annoying

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:33.733
to everyone else
in the quiet car.

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:35.735
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:41.207
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:43.242
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi
told reporters

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:45.078
at her press conference
yesterday

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:48.348
that she expects Democrats to
introduce legislation next month

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:51.350
to regulate stock trading
among members of Congress.

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:53.052
Or as she told her stockbroker,

00:00:53.052 --> 00:00:54.554
"Sell!"

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:57.056
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.056 --> 00:00:58.524
According to a new book,

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:01.861
then White House Chief of Staff
John Kelly was so angry

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:04.664
when former President Trump
refused to lower the flag

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:06.766
after Republican Senator
John McCain died

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:09.001
that he told Trump,
"When you die,

00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:11.905
the public will come to
your grave and piss on it."

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:13.172
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.172 --> 00:01:15.975
And if you think the line to see
the Queen is long...

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:17.143
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:20.313
According to the same book...

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:23.049
According to the same book...

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:24.550
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:26.886
We're just --
This is just book reports.

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:28.555
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.555 --> 00:01:30.155
This is --
Nothing here is political.

00:01:30.155 --> 00:01:32.158
We're just reporting on a book.

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:34.327
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:35.562
According to the same book,

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:38.364
the heir to cosmetics company
Estee Lauder

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:40.867
suggested to former
President Trump

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:42.368
that the U.S. buy Greenland.

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:44.804
It would have been
the first time Trump listened

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:46.639
to a cosmetics employee.

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:48.775
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:52.645
Former President Trump visited
his Virginia golf club this week

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:54.814
as it reportedly
undergoes renovations

00:01:54.814 --> 00:01:58.184
ahead of a Saudi-backed
LIV Golf tournament.

00:01:58.184 --> 00:02:01.688
He also helped oversee
packing VIP gift bags.

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:04.189
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.189 --> 00:02:07.627
A man in Kansas recently set
a Guinness World Record

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:10.296
for largest collection of
Kansas City Chiefs memorabilia,

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:11.697
with more than 1,000 pieces,

00:02:11.697 --> 00:02:14.467
while a man in Cleveland set
a Browns memorabilia record

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:15.969
with two.

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:18.304
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:20.806
Starbucks yesterday announced
a new growth plan

00:02:20.806 --> 00:02:22.975
which will add thousands
of new U.S. stores.

00:02:22.975 --> 00:02:23.977
Don't believe me?

00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:25.478
Look behind you.

00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:27.013
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.148 --> 00:02:30.817
Pretty nice living room.

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:31.985
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:33.752
The pilot of a rescue helicopter

00:02:33.752 --> 00:02:36.255
that reportedly left behind
a stranded hiker

00:02:36.255 --> 00:02:38.758
said that he thought
the man was just waving hi.

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:39.926
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:42.027
Even worse, the hiker
was actually waving

00:02:42.027 --> 00:02:44.530
at another helicopter
behind him.

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:46.599
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:51.671
And finally, singer Adele
this week

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:53.673
put her Beverly Hills mansion
up for sale.

00:02:53.673 --> 00:02:56.008
She said she has a lot of happy
memories in the house,

00:02:56.008 --> 00:02:58.845
which explains why we've never
heard a song about it.

00:02:58.845 --> 00:03:00.513
And that...

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:03.016
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.016 --> 00:03:04.517
...was a closer!

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:05.718
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.718 --> 00:03:07.053
That was a monologue, everybody.

